<title>USA: Collinsville, Ill., won by Magna Bank, St. Louis.</title>
<headline>Collinsville, Ill., won by Magna Bank, St. Louis.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magna Bank, St. Louis said it won $2.900 million of Collinsville, Ill., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.9614 percent.</p>
